  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> be in A.P. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>17</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>18</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the common difference of an A.P. be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(given)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>18</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>153</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>17</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>18</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>18</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>17</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>18</mn></msub></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></msqrt></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>",
